{% comment %}
  Figma accordion items with divider lines. Params:
    blocks     - array of blocks (settings.question / settings.answer)
    open_first - if true, first item renders open (black bar state)
  Falls back to the core tape FAQ items when no blocks exist.
{% endcomment %}
<div class="cbx-acc">
  <div class="cbx-acc__line"></div>
  {%- if blocks != blank -%}
    {%- for block in blocks -%}
      <details class="cbx-acc__item" {% if open_first and forloop.first %}open{% endif %} {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
        <summary>
          <p class="cbx-acc__q">{{ block.settings.question }}</p>
          <span class="cbx-acc__icon">
            <img class="cbx-i-plus" src="{{ 'cbx-icon-add.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="24" height="24">
            <img class="cbx-i-minus" src="{{ 'cbx-icon-minus.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="24" height="24">
          </span>
        </summary>
        {%- if block.settings.answer != blank -%}
          <p class="cbx-acc__a">{{ block.settings.answer }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
      </details>
      <div class="cbx-acc__line"></div>
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- else -%}
    {%- if preset == 'about' -%}
      {%- assign defaults = 'What is CARBEX LAB?|CARBEX LAB is a pickleball paddle care and protection brand. We make practical products that help players protect, clean, and maintain the equipment they use.|open;What products does CARBEX LAB currently offer?|Paddle Edge Guard Tape in 26 mm and 30 mm widths. A paddle surface cleaner is coming soon.;Which width do I need?|30 mm tape for 16 mm paddles, 26 mm tape for 14 mm paddles. Measure your paddle&#39;s thickness first.;Is the paddle in your photos for sale?|The paddles shown are for demonstration. CARBEX LAB products protect the paddle you already play with.' | split: ';' -%}
    {%- elsif preset == 'install' -%}
      {%- assign defaults = 'Which width do I need?|30 mm tape for 16 mm paddles, 26 mm tape for 14 mm paddles. Measure your paddle&#39;s thickness first.|open;How do I get it centered?|Fold the strip in half to find the middle, then start at the center of the top edge so the notches line up with the corners.;Why is my tape lifting at the edge?|The edge needs to be clean and fully dry before application. Peel back, clean again, and press firmly along the full strip.;Will the tape scuff?|Yes — that&#39;s the point. The tape takes the scuffs and scrapes so the paddle edge underneath stays clean. Replace it when it looks worn.;How many paddles does one pack cover?|Each pack includes 4 strips — one strip covers one full paddle edge.' | split: ';' -%}
    {%- else -%}
      {%- assign defaults = 'Which width do I need?|30 mm tape for 16 mm paddles, 26 mm tape for 14 mm paddles. Measure your paddle&#39;s thickness first.|open;How much tape is included?|Each pack includes 4 pre-cut strips — one strip covers one full paddle edge.;How do I install it?|Clean the edge, peel the liner, center the tape at the top edge, apply gradually and trim at the throat. See the installation guide for the full walkthrough.;Will the tape scuff?|Yes — that&#39;s the point. The tape takes the scuffs and scrapes so the paddle edge underneath stays clean. Replace it when it looks worn.;What products does CARBEX LAB currently offer?|Paddle Edge Guard Tape in 26 mm and 30 mm widths. A paddle surface cleaner is coming soon.' | split: ';' -%}
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- for item in defaults -%}
      {%- assign parts = item | split: '|' -%}
      <details class="cbx-acc__item" {% if parts[2] == 'open' %}open{% endif %}>
        <summary>
          <p class="cbx-acc__q">{{ parts[0] }}</p>
          <span class="cbx-acc__icon">
            <img class="cbx-i-plus" src="{{ 'cbx-icon-add.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="24" height="24">
            <img class="cbx-i-minus" src="{{ 'cbx-icon-minus.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="24" height="24">
          </span>
        </summary>
        <p class="cbx-acc__a">{{ parts[1] }}</p>
      </details>
      <div class="cbx-acc__line"></div>
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- endif -%}
</div>
